# Web3Forms access key — free, no account needed, 250 submissions/month.
# Get one in ~60s at https://web3forms.com using anasmallick846@gmail.com,
# then confirm the address from the email they send.
#
# Server-only on purpose: no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix, so the key never reaches the
